        <goldbook1:hasStatus>current</goldbook1:hasStatus>
        <dcterms:description>Compounds having the structure, $\ce{RS(=NR)2R}$, formally derived from sulfones by replacing $\ce{(=O)2}$ by $\ce{(=NR)2}$, e.g. $\ce{Ph2S(=NH)2}$ diphenyl sulfonediimine.</dcterms:description>
