        <goldbook1:hasStatus>current</goldbook1:hasStatus>
        <dcterms:description>Compounds having the structure $\ce{R3S+}$ and associated anion (generally, but not necessarily, all three $\ce{R}$ groups are hydrocarbyl). E.g. $\ce{[(CH3)3S]^{+}Cl^{−}}$, trimethylsulfonium chloride, or</dcterms:description>
